  "validationNotes": [
    "Baseline 8f101a65; no overlapping jobs. Existing differences belong to this phase. Start nameKey count 9323; all prior pending and publication state preserved.",
    "All 3 full official abilities/basic faces and 4 original/promo images visually reviewed. Utsusemi promo is the same card; an unrelated Gamburuman search hit is excluded. Current restrictions verified for all 3.",
    "Utsusemi: S-Trigger, Blocker and no attack; mandatory cost <=7 creature revival after leaving only if combined shields <=6 at resolution. Rule 603.4 verified with both 6 to 7 and 7 to 6 shield changes before resolution, hand/mana/grave departures and actual twin creature cost filtering in both seats.",
    "Gamburuman: full Star evolution and W-Breaker, count every own Fire creature or Fire Tamaseed once, then destroy only opposing Blockers. Fire Tamaseed/creature dual type is counted once, a Fire field is excluded. Both evolution branches, mandatory Star replacement and W breaks are covered.",
    "Giga: optional destruction-only replacement by exactly 3 ordered own grave cards; insufficient payment, decline, bounce, ignored abilities and one physical payment reserved once during simultaneous destruction. First grave departure triggers all sources present at the departure, including a source subsequently destroyed in the same event. Native observation now occurs at the payment event to retain that source.",
    "QA43059 reproduced by existing actual Luna/Darkness regressions and analogous new Giga revival tests; entering from grave cannot see its own first departure. QA42055 is verified by a related Apul no-movement analogue using Giga grave payment/selection, not a claim to reproduce the exact Bell Abyss Rush scenario. Rule 603.4 reproduced by Utsusemi tests.",
    "52 focused tests passed in split runs of 48 complete tests plus 4 newly added edge tests; 110 grave/replacement and 163 trigger/online regressions passed, total 325. Pending choices survive encrypted online storage, private projections, legal forty-card games, unique physical IDs and JSON continuation in both seats.",
    "Earlier focused failures exposed the Tamaseed count flag and observation timing, both corrected and impact regressions passed. Fixture corrections exclude a true cost-9 twin and handle automatic mandatory Star replacement. npm run check, audit, target9500 and baseline invariants passed. nameKey count 9326. No push/publication/Netlify update."
